Homework #9 - Week 14

In this practice I created a word cloud but the dataset doesnt have real text like reviews or product names, instead I used the categorical columns I have product_category, payment_method and customer_region and i repeated each word by the number of times it appears in the csv so the cloud reflects the frequency

The dataset is very balanced each category appears the same ammount of times. There is not one word that dominates the cloud, about what I learned is how to use the wordcloud library and how to prepare the text data
